        },
        "description": "Eve is the main protagonist of the BIRDIE WING: Golf Girls' Story series. She is a survivor who made a living by betting on golf. Her struggling past resulted in a rough and powerful playing style.\n\n~!In Part 2, it is revealed that Eve is the daughter of famed golfer Kazuhiko Amawashi and Elanor Burton, the daughter of the CEO of Arios, who both were victims of a tragic cruising accident which also resulted in Eve's amnesia!~",
