    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 253819,
        "name": {
          "full": "Aoi Amawashi",
          "native": "天鷲葵",
          "alternative": [
            "Innocent Tyrant"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b253819-ui4XCjXVnag3.png"
        },
        "description": "Aoi Amawashi is the daughter of the Tenwashi Group, one of the largest corporations in the world, and a thoroughbred in the golf world. Being the ace of the prestigious Raijin Girls’ Academy golf club, Aoi became known as the \"Innocent Tyrant\" as she enjoys golf and defeats her opponents with a sweet and innocent smile\n\n~!In Part 2, it is reveled that Aoi's father is not famed golfer Kazuhiko Amawashi, but instead is Reiya Amuro, her coach. Aoi sadly seems to also have inherited Reiya's health problems, as she is seen to struggle with a form of fatigue like Reiya did.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "15"
