    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 258745,
        "name": {
          "full": "Reiya Amuro",
          "native": "亜室麗矢",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b258745-x10WDg0SecTw.png"
        },
        "description": "Reiya Amuro is the head coach of the golf team at Raijin Girls’ Academy. A former professional golfer who's pro career was cut short, Reiya manages the golf team and acts as Aoi's mentor as she progresses in her own pro career. He also brings Eve onto the team and teaches her to a degree.\n\n~!In Season 2, it is revealed that Reiya is more than just Aoi's coach, he is also her biological father. In his last game as a professional golfer, where Reiya was playing for the right to marry his lover, fellow golfer Seira, a sudden physical illness forced him to drop out of the competition, causing him to lose both the tournament and Seira's hand to Kazuhiko Amawashi. Yet beforehand, he managed to get Seira pregnant with his kid, who would be Aoi. Kazuhiko found out about Reiya and Seira's kid, and agreed to raise Aoi as his own daughter, keeping the affair secret from the public. After hiding the truth from Aoi for fifteen years, Reiya eventually would confirm Aoi's suspicions that he was her real father.!~",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 95326,
          "name": {
            "full": "Tooru Furuya",
            "native": "古谷徹"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95326-OfRv2DBnFVZU.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 258746,
        "name": {
          "full": "Leo Millafoden",
          "native": "レオ・ミラフォーデン",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b258746-4wo4jMeOfsOL.png"
        },
        "description": "Leo Millafoden is an underground golfer and Eve's golf coach for much of her childhood. Through Leo, Eve was able to learn how to use \"Bullets\", high-energy golf swings. Eventually, Leo left Eve on her own.\n\n~!It is revealed that Leo also tutored Rose Aleon, Eve's main underground golf handler, but quit being her mentor when Rose continued to get herself further and further into the mob scene!~\n\n~!It is revealed in Season 2 that Leo was unbeatable, and only Kazuhiko Amawashi was able to defeat him in a match. Inspired by Kazuhiko's skills as a golfer, Leo made it his goal to combine Kazuhiko's and his skills into one golfer to create the greatest golfer. He found his opportunity upon discovering that Kazuhiko had a surviving daughter named \"Eve\", and sought her out in the hopes she inherited Kazuhiko's skills so that he could instill his techniques into her to achieve his goal!~",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
